<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><!--
    English translation for XiaoHyperCleaner.

    COMPLIANCE:
    - accessibility_policy_description meets Google Play Accessibility Services API Policy
    - consent_dialog_* implements explicit user consent
    - All official Android/Xiaomi terminology used correctly

    NOTES:
    - Plurals: English uses only "one" and "other" (2 forms)
